From dd4579a706dc5a51992e82d46e5043f839463a6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Breno Brito <brenorb@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:55:07 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(coq): register original fe_multiply and fe_square
 coverage

Adds simplicity_fe_multiply -> C.jet_parallel_fe_mul_local
fe_multiply_literal_local_spec and simplicity_fe_square ->
C.jet_parallel_fe_sqr_local fe_square_literal_local_spec, lists all 135 public
results and 158 contract definitions of the 13 modules, admits both names to
the secp whole-contract coverage set with mutation tests, and wires the
mul-review source gate (13 reviewed definitions/propositions, 41 rejected
mutations) into check-jets.sh. Snapshots are not updated here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
